login.h4_f:
on ຜົນ​ສໍາ​ເລັດ​: 201 + JWT envelope (ຮູບ​ແບບ​ດຽວ​ກັນ​ກັບ​ການ​ຈົດ​ທະ​ບຽນ​)
ຢູ່ໃນ 2FA ຕ້ອງການ: 200 { "needs_2fa": true } (ບໍ່ມີ JWT ເທື່ອ)
ກ່ຽວກັບຄວາມລົ້ມເຫຼວ: 401 { "error":"invalid_credentials" }

refresh.h4_f:
{
  "access_token": "eyJ…",
  "refresh_token": "eyJ…" // ພຽງແຕ່ຖ້າ ROTATE_REFRESH=true
}

apns.h1_f:
POST https://api.push.apple.com/3/device/<device_token>
ສ່ວນຫົວ: apns-topic: <bundle_id>, apns-push-type: alert, apns-collapse-id: room:42
ເນື້ອໃນ: {aps: {alert: {title, body}}, data: <sealed>}

bmp.h1_f:
mailbox_id = HKDF(recipient_pubkey, info="bmp-v1", len=32)
ເງິນຝາກ: POST /bmp/ເງິນຝາກ {mailbox_id, blob ≤1MB}
ຮັບ: GET /bmp/ຂໍ້ຄວາມ (auth'd)

controller.h1_f:
GET /v1/integrity → {ສະຖານະ, signed_by, matched, mismatched, …}
GET /v1/health → {ສະຖານະ, ລຸ້ນ, pubkey, ສະຖິຕິ}
GET /v1/ລາຍການ → [{protocol, url}, …]
GET /v1/ກະຈົກ → [controller_url, …]

fcm.h1_f:
POST https://fcm.googleapis.com/v1/projects/<project>/messages:send
ການອະນຸຍາດ: Bearer <oauth2_token>
ເນື້ອໃນ: {ຂໍ້ຄວາມ: {token: <device>, ຂໍ້ມູນ: {...sealed...}, android: {collapse_key}}}

federation.h1_f:
envelope = {source_node, target_user, inner_ct, inner_nonce, send_at}
sig = Ed25519-Sign(source_priv, CBOR(ຊອງຈົດໝາຍ))
POST /federation/delivery {ຊອງຈົດໝາຍ, sig}
B ຢືນຢັນ: ເຊັນຕໍ່ກັບສະຫະພັນ[source_node].pubkey

fts5.h1_f:
CREATE VIRTUAL TABLE messages_fts USING fts5(
  ເນື້ອໃນ, -- ຖັນ tokenised
  room_id UNINDEXED,
  tokenize = 'unicode61 remove_diacritics 2'
);
ສອບຖາມ: SELECT rowid FROM messages_fts WHERE ເນື້ອໃນ MATCH 'foo'

gravitix.h1_f:
on /start { emit "ຍິນດີຕ້ອນຮັບ, {ctx.first_name}" }
ສຸດ /add <item> {
  state.list = (state.list ຫຼື []) + [ctx.args.item]
  ປ່ອຍ "ເພີ່ມ: {ctx.args.item}"
}

prekey.h1_f:
ມັດ = {
  identity_pk,
  signed_prekey_pk,
  signed_prekey_sig = Ed25519-Sign(identity_priv, signed_prekey_pk),
  one_time_prekeys: [pk_0, pk_1, ..., pk_9]
}

vapid.h1_f:
ກະແຈVAPID: Ed25519 keypair ຕໍ່ node
ເຊັນ JWT: {aud: push_service_origin, exp: now + 12h, sub: mailto:ops@example}
push headers: ການອະນຸຍາດ: vapid t=<jwt>, k=<vapid_public_key>
